{
 "id": 1828196,
 "titulo": "12/3 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1733209245618,
 "modificada": 1737647646380,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1828196",
 "html": "<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1730183358082\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/39459a175a9c4b0bbbc99637c32378d7_1730183358082_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">Greetings, Agents. </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"color:null;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">In this patch, meet the two most formidable Super Villains&nbsp;<br>\nthat the symbiotes of justice have long been on guard against.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Knull</span><span style=\"color:null;\">, who has obtained the Tier-4 Advancement and a new Uniform, has risen from his throne&nbsp;<br>\nto bring his dark plans.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Carnage</span><span style=\"color:null;\">, with the powers of his new Uniform, plans to unleash even more brutal massacres.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:null;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated heroes<br>\nby downloading the 12/3 Patch!</span></span></span></span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"color:#740060\">■ 12/3 Patch Details</span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Patch Schedule: 12/4 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 12/3 (Tue) 19:00 (PST)</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">[12/4 (Wed) 2:44 (UTC+0), 12/3 (Tue) 18:44 added]</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">The patch has been completed as of 12/4 (Wed) 2:44 (UTC+0), 12/3 (Tue) 18:44 (PST).<br>\nPlease reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">The completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The game can still be accessed during the patch.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">When the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Two New Uniforms</span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">1. Two new Uniforms, &nbsp;Knull &lt;Ancient History&gt; and Carnage &lt;Superior Carnage&gt; have been added.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The new Uniform can be purchased after the 12/3 Patch data has been applied.<br>\n* The new Uniform can be found and purchased at the Marvel Universe and the Uniform Room.<br>\n* The skill effects of the new Uniforms are based on the following.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1733203208034\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/8c7c223975d04a8eb654feeea7bcf4ba_1733203208034_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1733203216501\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7f5160b49adc42bdbcc38db923a9d673_1733203216501_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">▣ Knull Tier-4</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:null;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">The King of the Symbiotes has returned with newfound power!<br>\nTier-4 advancement is now available for Knull.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1733203190368\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/cdc40fa97fc64defad39ca18dedd690c_1733203190368_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">▣ New Artifact</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:null;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">A new Artifact for Knull has been added.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1733203155996\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e0b0eb701b2b4591899e7e8ec3c76f33_1733203155996_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">▣ Other Improvements and Changes</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:null;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">1. The Skill Restriction in the Zombie Survival has been improved.<br>\n- The number of restricted Skills has been adjusted.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Before: 3 skills restricted<br>\nAfter: 2 or 3 skills restricted</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:null;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">- Certain Skill Restriction groups that increase gameplay fatigue have been removed.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:null;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">- The current Skill Restriction will be changed after the 12/3 Patch.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Before: Restricts Active Skill 1, 4, 5<br>\nAfter the Patch: Restricts Active Skill 1, 2, 4</span></span></span></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">* Records, Rankings, and Challenges will remain. Only the Skill Restriction will be changed.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">▣ Game Error Fixes</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:null;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">1. Agent Venom &lt;Classic&gt; does not attack the target after the charging motion when using Active Skill 2 has been fixed.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:null;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">We look forward to your active participation in the events that will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:null;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Thank you.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1733203104669\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/2cc6b79c5ec341c98bc80f5620760950_1733203104669_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n"
}